The '''Forbidden Forest''' (Japanese: '''禁断の森''' ''Forbidden Forest'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive {{type|Grass}} {{OBP|Pokémon|species}} reserve that appeared in ''[[AG073|Grass Hysteria!]]''. It is located somewhere between [[Littleroot Town]] and [[Fortree City]].

No humans have been allowed in the Forbidden Forest after people repeatedly tried to {{pkmn2|caught|catch}} all of the resident Pokémon. Consequently, the Pokémon grew increasingly hostile towards [[human]]s. As a solution, some people established a village, currently led by [[Old Man Obee]], to watch over the area, and also permanently sealed off the forest with a huge wooden fence. A {{p|Venusaur}} is the "boss" of the Forest. The area's peculiar magnetic field, which affects electronics and navigation tools, ensures many travelers are unaware of the Forbidden Forest.

May was kidnapped by a {{p|Skarmory}} and was dropped into the [[forest]]. While exploring, May met a {{TP|May|Bulbasaur}} trying to pick flowers. It warmed up to her and defended her from the other Grass Pokémon, who saw her as a threat. When May left the forest, Bulbasaur decided to go with her.

